<div id="2026-10-29-healthkitchen-day-embed" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-29 — Health Kitchen embeds the day view</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> <code>/healthkitchen</code> shows today by embedding <code>/todo/day</code> with <code>filter=schedule</code>. That filter keeps the personal day blocks and does not change the session calendar filter.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> A second schedule list would drift from the calendar. The day grid is the schedule.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Controller/Todo.pm</code>, <code>root/todo/day.tt</code>, <code>root/healthkitchen/index.tt</code>.</p>
</div>
